Generate Python code that creates a Django REST framework JSON renderer backed by Orjson:
```python
from rest_framework import renderers
from django.contrib.json import orjson

class OrjsonRenderer(renderers.JSONRenderer):
   def render(self, data, media_type, serializer):
       return orjson.dumps(data)
```
